{
  "default": "standard-dialogue-before-observatory-quest",
  "variants": {
    "standard-dialogue-before-observatory-quest": [
      {
        "npc": "Hello."
      },
      {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "Talk about the Observatory quest.",
            "steps": [
              {
                "player": "Hi, I was..."
              },
              {
                "npc": "Welcome to the magnificent wonder of the Observatory, where wonder is all around you, where the stars can be clutched from the heavens!"
              },
              {
                "player": "Wow, nice intro."
              },
              {
                "npc": "Why, thanks! How might I help you?"
              },
              {
                "type": "choice",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "text": "I'm totally lost.",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "npc": "Lost? It must have been those pesky goblins that led you astray."
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "Head north-east to find the city of Ardougne."
                      },
                      {
                        "player": "I'm sure I'll find the way."
                      },
                      {
                        "player": "Thanks for all your help."
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "No problem at all. Come and visit again!"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "message",
                        "text": "The professor carries on with his studies.",
                        "id": "zbpFGz"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "An Observatory?",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "player": "An Observatory?"
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "Of course. We have a superb telescope up in the Observatory, on the hill."
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "A truly marvellous invention, the likes of which you'll never behold again."
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "line",
                        "speaker": "Observatory assistant",
                        "text": "Well, it would be if it worked."
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "Don't interrupt!"
                      },
                      {
                        "player": "What? It doesn't work?"
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "Oh, no, no, no. Don't listen to him, he's joking. Aren't you, my FAITHFUL assistant?"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "line",
                        "speaker": "Observatory assistant",
                        "text": "Nope, dead serious. Hasn't been working for a long time."
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "Arghhh! Get back to work and stop sticking your nose in!"
                      },
                      {
                        "player": "So, it's broken. How come?"
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "Oh, I suppose there's no use keeping it secret. Did you see those houses outside?"
                      },
                      {
                        "player": "Up on the hill? Yes, I've seen them."
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "It's a horde of goblins."
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "Since they moved here they have caused nothing but trouble."
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "Last week, my telescope was tampered with."
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "Now, parts need replacing before it can be used again. They've even been messing around in the dungeons under this area. Something needs to be done."
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "line",
                        "speaker": "Observatory assistant",
                        "text": "Strikes me that this visitor could help us."
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "Stop being so rude."
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "..."
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "Although, he has a point. What do you say?"
                      },
                      {
                        "player": "What, me?"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "choice",
                        "prompt": "Start the Observatory Quest?",
                        "options": [
                          {
                            "text": "Yes.",
                            "steps": [
                              {
                                "player": "Sounds interesting, what can I do for you?"
                              },
                              {
                                "npc": "Oh, thanks so much."
                              },
                              {
                                "npc": "I shall need some materials for the telescope, so it can be used again."
                              },
                              {
                                "npc": "Let's start with three planks of wood for the telescope base. My assistant will help with obtaining these, won't you?"
                              },
                              {
                                "type": "line",
                                "speaker": "Observatory assistant",
                                "text": "As if I don't have enough work to do. Seems I don't have a choice."
                              },
                              {
                                "npc": "Go talk to him if you need some advice."
                              },
                              {
                                "player": "Okay, I'll be right back."
                              }
                            ],
                            "hook": "quest:observatory-quest:start",
                            "quest": "Observatory Quest"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "No.",
                            "steps": [
                              {
                                "player": "Oh, sorry, I don't have time for that."
                              },
                              {
                                "npc": "Oh dear. I really do need some help."
                              },
                              {
                                "npc": "If you see anyone who can help then please send them my way."
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "I'm just passing through.",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "player": "I'm just passing through."
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "Fair enough. Not everyone is interested in this place, I suppose."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Talk about Treasure Trails.",
            "steps": [
              {
                "npc": "Welcome back! How can I help you today?"
              },
              {
                "player": "Can you teach me to solve treasure trail clues?"
              },
              {
                "npc": "Ah, I get asked about treasure trails all the time! Listen carefully and I shall tell you what I know..."
              },
              {
                "npc": "Lots of clues have degrees and minutes written on them. These are the coordinates of the place where the treasure is buried."
              },
              {
                "npc": "You have to walk to the correct spot, so that your coordinates are exactly the same as the values written on the clue scroll."
              },
              {
                "npc": "To do this, you must use a sextant, a watch and a chart to find your own coordinates."
              },
              {
                "npc": "Once you know the coordinates of the place where you are, you know which way you have to walk to get to the place where the treasure is!"
              },
              {
                "player": "Riiight. So where do I get those items from?"
              },
              {
                "npc": "I think Murphy, the owner of the fishing trawler moored south of Ardougne, might be able to spare you a sextant. Then the nearest Clock Tower is south of Ardougne - you could probably get a watch there. I've"
              },
              {
                "npc": "got plenty of charts myself, here have one."
              },
              {
                "type": "condition",
                "text": "If the player has inventory space:",
                "action_source": "text",
                "steps": [
                  {
                    "type": "message",
                    "text": "The professor has given you a navigation chart.",
                    "id": "dZ3Yhh"
                  },
                  {
                    "player": "Thanks, I'll see you later."
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "end"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "qOLtp6"
              },
              {
                "type": "condition",
                "text": "If the player does not have inventory space:",
                "action_source": "text",
                "steps": [
                  {
                    "npc": "You don't have enough space for the chart. Come back to me when you do."
                  }
                ],
                "id": "dGMRH3"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
